pyxdf (1.17.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian/NeuroDebian packaging.
    Not in Debian, Ubuntu or NeuroDebian.
  * Build with pybuild (hatchling backend); version supplied via
    SETUPTOOLS_SCM_PRETEND_VERSION.
  * Relax the numpy build/runtime requirement from >=2.0.2 to >=1.21 so the
    package is installable on numpy 1.26 (Debian/Ubuntu) -- see
    debian/patches/relax-numpy-requirement.patch.

